            "text": "{\"proposals\":[{\"rationale\":\"Add a companion exception record for the emergency exception in paragraph (c), qualifying the driver prohibition baseline C0000 while leaving the permission baseline C0003 intact.\",\"operation\":\"add\",\"target\":\"\",\"qualifies\":[\"C0000\"],\"quote\":\"(c) Emergency exception. Using a hand-held mobile telephone is permissible by drivers of a CMV when necessary to communicate with law enforcement officials or other emergency services.\",\"fields\":{\"concepts\":[],\"claimants\":[],\"typed_values\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"defined_terms\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"kind\":\"exception\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(c) Emergency exception. Using a hand-held mobile telephone is permissible by drivers of a CMV when necessary to communicate with law enforcement officials or other emergency services.\"],\"scope_text\":\"when necessary to communicate with law enforcement officials or other emergency services\",\"context_quotes\":[],\"modality_quote\":\"\",\"modality\":\"not_stated\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"choice_quote\":\"\",\"choice_text\":\"\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"actor_quote\":\"drivers of a CMV\",\"actor\":\"drivers of a CMV\",\"action_quote\":\"Using a hand-held mobile telephone\",\"action\":\"using a hand-held mobile telephone\",\"object_quote\":\"a hand-held mobile telephone\",\"object\":\"a hand-held mobile telephone\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"relation\":\"exception\",\"references\":[],\"summary\":\"As an exception to the prohibition on drivers using a hand-held mobile telephone while driving a CMV, using a hand-held mobile telephone is permissible by drivers of a CMV when necessary to communicate with law enforcement officials or other emergency services.\"}}],\"observations\":[{\"quote\":\"(2) No motor carrier shall allow or require its drivers to use a hand-held mobile telephone while driving a CMV.\",\"rationale\":\"Paragraph (c) explicitly frames the emergency exception around us